1
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,990
It was Sunday.

2
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:22,030
I never get up early on Sundays.

3
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:26,810
I sometimes stay in bed until lunchtime.

4
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:31,060
Last Sunday I got up very late.

5
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:33,450
I looked out of the window.

6
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:35,840
It was dark outside.

7
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:37,720
'What a day!'

8
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:39,600
I thought.

9
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,610
'It's raining again.'

10
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:46,040
Just then, the telephone rang.

11
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:49,040
It was my aunt Lucy.

12
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:53,090
'I've just arrived by train,' she said.

13
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:56,010
'I'm coming to see you.'

14
00:00:56,010 --> 00:01:00,540
'But I'm still having breakfast,' I said.

15
00:01:00,540 --> 00:01:02,692
'What are you doing?'

16
00:01:02,692 --> 00:01:03,840
she asked.

17
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:07,500
'I'm having breakfast,' I repeated.

18
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,400
'Dear me,' she said.

19
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:13,390
'Do you always get up so late?

20
00:01:13,390 --> 00:01:18,549
It's one o'clock!'
